                        "username": "LeoWu-wiwynn"
                    },
                    "message": "Want to use a generic SEL format to describe device inserted/removed and device power on/off events.\nHowever, I don\u2019t see any existing events.yaml definitions for these cases in phosphor-dbus-interfaces, so I\u2019m planning to define new SEL entries for them under xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.\n\nIn addition, since chassis and host can have multiple power states, I designed this as a powerStateChange event, with the specific state passed in as a parameter for flexibility."
